  "title": "Breakfast Prune Spice Cake",
  "description": "Chopped prunes add moistness to this spiced breakfast cake. This cake was a favorite of mine as a child - probably because it meant I could have cake for breakfast!",
  "authors": [
    "LauraG"
  ],
